flowchart TD
  Guest[Guest browser] --> CDN[CDN / Edge cache]
  CDN --> FE[React + Bootstrap SPA<br/>Static hosting: Vercel]
  FE --> API[API Gateway / Load Balancer]
  API --> BFF[Spring Boot services<br/>Stateless horizontal replicas]
  BFF --> Auth[Identity / OAuth]
  BFF --> Listing[Listing service]
  BFF --> Booking[Booking & availability service]
  BFF --> Search[Search service]
  Listing --> Cache[(Redis cache)]
  Search --> Index[(Search index<br/>OpenSearch / Elasticsearch)]
  Listing --> DB[(Relational DB<br/>PostgreSQL primary + replicas)]
  Booking --> DB
  Booking --> Queue[Event queue]
  Queue --> Notify[Notification workers]
  Listing --> Object[(Object storage<br/>photos / media)]
  Object --> CDN
  BFF --> Obs[Logs, metrics, traces<br/>alerts]
  FE --> Obs
